# ── Repo hygiene: only the 8 lab folders + their required files are visible ──
# Whitelist approach: ignore everything at repo root, then re-include
# the lab folders and this git metadata file.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/Lab1
!/Lab2
!/Lab3
!/Lab4
!/Lab5
!/Lab6
!/Lab7
!/Lab8

# Tooling / scratch inside the labs — not required by the assignments:
#   captures/  = raw terminal logs & figure screenshots used to build reports
#   build_*.py = report compiler scripts
#   notes.md   = working notes
Lab*/captures/
Lab*/build_*.py
Lab*/notes.md

# Junk that should never be committed anywhere:
**/*~
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
